#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: en/chapters/admin_guide.xml:1639
msgid ""
"Sometimes, it is necessary to ban <glossterm>IP address</glossterm>es or "
"hostnames in order to prevent unwanted users. There may be certain users or "
"spam bots that use IPs or hostnames that you are aware of. Here, in the "
