"chiunque possa vederli."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: en/chapters/admin_guide.xml:2142
msgid ""
"I have Full Administrator permissions. Why can I not see my new forums?"
msgstr ""
"Ho i permessi da Amministratore completo. Perché non riesco a vedere i miei "
"nuovi forum?"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: en/chapters/admin_guide.xml:2144
msgid ""
"Administrator Permissions have nothing to do with Forum Permissions. You "
"have to assign Forum Permissions for yourself or your user group before you "
